          "title": "Overview",
          "bullets": [
            {
              "id": "1a.1",
              "text": "Aldan House and its east wing were destroyed in a residential building collapse on Cobbett Row, Nerridge, resulting in deaths and injuries.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": []
            },
            {
              "id": "1a.2",
              "text": "Provincial Urban Search and Rescue (PUSAR) deployed and rescued people, while emergency services managed the response and documented injuries.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": []
            },
            {
              "id": "1a.3",
              "text": "Warnings were issued for Cobbett Row, and later reports confirmed the west wing did not collapse, with restoration efforts underway for Aldan House and the tower crane in Imber Street.",
